{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50938","headline":"冬尽 · 吕从庆","name":"冬尽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年惟腊在，忽忽又将央。\n雪重庭枝折，风轻径蘂香。\n感时空有恨，留岁竟无方。\n老矣当樽客，他乡作故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}